  "title": "Pocket Monsters Advanced Generation",
  "justification": "TVDB 76703 moved two episodes of season 8 into season 0: AniDB 101 Shaking Island Battle! Barboach vs Whiscash! is season 0 episode 74 of that title (abs 380), and AniDB 121 Ash \u0026 May! Heated Battles in Hoenn!! (2005-03-24) is season 0 episode 75 Ash and May! Heated Battles of Hoenn!! (abs 400). Season 8 now has 52 episodes, so the old row put 101 on Vanity Affair and every later episode one or two places late: 102 Vanity Affair is season 8 episode 9, 120 The Ribbon Cup Caper! is 27, 122 Hi Ho Silver Wind! is 28, 146 Pasta La Vista! is 52. The season 8 row is split in place; the others stay.",
